    "releaseNotes": "# AID v1.0.0-beta.4 测试版\n\n## 中文更新说明\n\n- 为官方风格、用户自定义风格和项目增加角色、场景、道具三类隐藏风格提示词，生成链路使用项目快照，避免后续风格配置变化影响已有项目。\n- 项目创建与更新统一保存风格来源、公开描述和隐藏描述快照；项目已有角色、场景或道具后锁定风格切换，同时保留其他生成配置的正常编辑能力。\n- 后台管理增加隐藏风格提示词分区编辑和项目快照只读展示，普通项目编辑不会覆盖已经固化的风格快照。\n- Web 精选风格库支持官方与自定义风格合并分页、稳定来源标识、当前风格定位和锁定提示，修复历史项目风格识别与重复选择问题。\n- 优化后台左上角版本信息面板的视觉布局与点击交互，减少遮挡和误跳转。\n- 修复登录后直接访问后台入口码路径时错误进入 404 的问题，合法入口会完成校验后进入首页。\n- 新增可重复执行的 `sql/v1.0.0-beta.4.sql`，补齐隐藏风格字段与查询索引，并只同步开源初始化库现有的 51 个官方风格。\n- `sql/aid-init.sql` 已内置上述 51 个官方风格隐藏描述；不会导入测试库中的其他扩展风格或内部数据。\n- 清理重复的临时风格 SQL 和独立智能体教程初始化脚本，开源安装统一以 `sql/aid-init.sql` 为初始化真源。\n\n\u003e 本版本为 Beta 测试版。升级前请备份数据库和部署配置，并先在测试环境验证项目创建、风格选择、资产生成和后台管理流程。\n\n# AID v1.0.0-beta.4 Beta Release\n\n## English Release Notes\n\n- Added separate hidden style prompts for characters, scenes, and props across official styles, custom styles, and projects. Generation now uses project snapshots so later style changes do not alter existing projects.\n- Project creation and updates now persist the style source, public description, and hidden prompt snapshot. Style switching is locked after character, scene, or prop assets exist, while other generation settings remain editable.\n- Added structured hidden-prompt editing in the admin console and read-only project snapshot views. Normal project edits no longer overwrite frozen style snapshots.\n- Improved the Web style library with merged pagination for official and custom styles, stable source identities, current-style location, and clear lock feedback. Historical style matching and duplicate-selection issues were fixed.\n- Redesigned the admin sidebar version panel for clearer status presentation, stable click behavior, and reduced visual obstruction.\n- Fixed direct navigation to a valid admin access-code path after login. The route is verified and redirected to the dashboard instead of showing a 404 page.\n- Added the repeatable `sql/v1.0.0-beta.4.sql` migration to create hidden-style fields and the required query index, while updating only the 51 styles already present in the open-source baseline.\n- Embedded the same 51 official hidden style descriptions in `sql/aid-init.sql`. No additional test-only styles or internal records are imported.\n- Removed redundant temporary style SQL files and the standalone agent tutorial initializer. Open-source installations now use `sql/aid-init.sql` as the single initialization source.\n\n\u003e This is a Beta release. Back up the database and deployment configuration, then validate project creation, style selection, asset generation, and admin workflows in a staging environment before production use.",
